## KNOWN ISSUES & SOLUTIONS

### Thai TTS on Android Emulator
- **Issue**: Garbled/unintelligible Thai speech on Android emulator
- **Cause**: Missing Thai TTS engine on emulator
- **Solution**: 
  - Use Google TTS engine if available: `flutter_tts` with language 'th-TH', speech rate 0.35, pitch 1.0
  - Test on physical device with proper Thai TTS support
  - Add debug logging to check available engines and voices

### App Name Display Issues
- **Issue**: App shows "flutter_naming" instead of "ชื่อดี" under icon
- **Solution**: Update all platform configuration files:
  - Android: `android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml` (android:label)
  - iOS: `ios/Runner/Info.plist` (CFBundleDisplayName)
  - Web: `web/index.html` (title tag)
  - macOS: `macos/Runner/Config/AppInfo.xcconfig`
- **Note**: Rebuild app after changes

### TTS Race Condition Crash
- **Issue**: App crashes with `java.lang.IllegalStateException: Reply already submitted` when pressing "เลขศาสตร์ดี" button
- **Cause**: Multiple concurrent TTS initializations causing race condition
- **Solution**: Use singleton pattern with static `Completer` in `name_list_item.dart`
  - Implement static shared `FlutterTts` instance
  - Use static `Completer` to manage initialization
  - Prevent multiple concurrent `initialize()` calls

### Premium Filter Logic Issues
- **Issue**: "พลังเงาดี" filter showing names with "เลขศาสตร์ดี" badge
- **Solution**: Implement exclusive filter logic:
  - "พลังเงาดี" shows only names with that badge AND WITHOUT "เลขศาสตร์ดี"
  - "เลขศาสตร์ดี" shows only names with that badge AND WITHOUT "พลังเงาดี"

### Similar Results Disappearance
- **Issue**: "รายชื่อที่มีความหมายใกล้เคียง" disappears when cancelling both premium filters
- **Solution**: Ensure `_search()` is called when `willKeepRankingCriteria` is false in filter toggle handlers

### SSH Authentication in Deployment
- **Issue**: `deploy.sh` script fails with public key authentication errors
- **Solution**: Add SSH flags to all `ssh` and `scp` commands:
  `-o PubkeyAuthentication=no -o PasswordAuthentication=yes`

### Premium Feature Testing Bypass
- **For testing only**: Set `_bypassForTesting = true` in `premium_manager.dart`
- **Effect**: `PremiumManager().isPremium` and `canUsePremiumFeature` return true
- **Warning**: Disable in production; users can use premium features without purchase







